PayTune — Full Video Marketplace Architecture & Feature Specification
PayTune is a YouTube-style video streaming marketplace where users purchase individual videos once and receive unlimited streaming access to those videos for as long as the platform can legally and technically provide them. Approved creators earn money from sales, and PayTune retains a commission on each successful purchase.

The goal is to combine YouTube's familiar discovery experience, a professional streaming service, a creator marketplace, and a secure pay-per-video business model — without requiring monthly subscriptions.







