Keep storage keys private. Never use an uploaded filename as a trusted storage path. Only publish a video after required assets are ready and moderation requirements are satisfied.
C. Orders, payments, purchases and entitlements

CREATE TABLE orders (
    id BIGINT UNSIGNED AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
    public_id CHAR(36) NOT NULL UNIQUE,
    user_id BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,
    video_id BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,
