10. API endpoint specification
Use a versioned REST API under /api/v1. The examples below define the main contract; each endpoint still needs request validation, authorization, response schemas and consistent error handling.
Authentication and accounts
Method	Endpoint	Purpose
POST	/auth/register	Register a viewer
POST	/auth/login	Authenticate
POST	/auth/logout	Revoke current session
